          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "BWANA ukamzera Musa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.7.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.7.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 7:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kuwizere wandu wa Israeli huwu: uo ose ufunyagha kizongona cha mapatano, uchamfunyira BWANA kizongona icho; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.7.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.7.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 7:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "uchareda mavuda na kidari cha iyo nyamandu kwa mikonu yake moni, na kuvifunya vikaie mafunyo gha kizongona chekora kwa BWANA, eri kidari chipate kusughuswa chiwuye mafunyo kwa BWANA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.7.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.7.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 7:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mkohani uchakora agho mavuda aighu ya madhabahu, ela kidari chichawuya cha Haruni na wana wake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.7.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.7.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 7:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na nyama ya bara ya mkonu ghwa kiwomi kuchaineka mkohani, ipate kukaia ifunyo jifumagha kwa kizongona cha mapatano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.7.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.7.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 7:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umu wa wana wa Haruni, uo ufunyagha bagha na mavuda gha kizongona cha mapatano, nuo uko na hachi enekwa iyo bara ya mkonu ghwa kiwomi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.7.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.7.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 7:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Icho kidari chisughuswagha, na iyo bara ifunywagha neeviwusa kufuma kwa vizongona va mapatano va wandu wa Israeli, na kumneka Haruni uo mkohani na wana wake, vikaie mafungu ghawo gha kari kose kufuma kwa Waisraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.7.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.7.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 7:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ijo ni ifungu ja Haruni na wana wake jifunyiro kufuma kwa mafunyo gha vizongona vekorwa kwa BWANA, jikawikwa kukaia jawo kufuma ituku werewikiloghe wakfu wikaie wakohani wa BWANA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.7.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.7.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 7:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "BWANA orelaghirieghe winekoghe vindo ivi ni wandu wa Israeli, kufuma ituku jija werewikiloghe wakfu kwa kushingwa mavuda, vikaie mafungu ghawo gha kari kose kufuma kwa wandu wa Israeli vivalwa vichagha.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.7.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.7.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
